This submission contains two top-level PDFLaTeX documents.

Compile and order them as follows:

1. paper.tex
2. supplement.tex

paper.tex is the main preprint. supplement.tex is the standalone Online
Supplement. Both files compile from this directory. paper.bbl is supplied to
make the bibliography independent of BibTeX availability, and the matching
bibliography/references.bib is included for source completeness.

The bundle contains only TeX inputs, the figures and tables read by those
inputs, the public CSV records displayed verbatim in the supplement, and the
bibliography. It contains no licensed financial rows, executable research
code, version-control data, logs, or auxiliary build files.
